# Cloud Run image needs only the backend, pinned dependencies, and the final
# versioned ONNX artifact. Keeping the client data/training workspace out of the
# build context avoids multi-gigabyte transfers and accidental data inclusion.
*
!requirements.txt
!app/
!app/**
!artifacts/
!artifacts/v1.4.0-int8/
!artifacts/v1.4.0-int8/**

# Re-excluded after the allow-list above (last match wins).
# Offline batch tooling: line_filters.py carries vocabulary tuned to one XML
# batch and is imported only by scripts/67, 68, 72 and its own test. Nothing in
# the serving path touches it, so it does not belong in the deployed image.
app/inference/line_filters.py
app/inference/cloud_run_smoke_test.py
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
